/*
  Component:  Plate 50 x 50 x 3
  Standard:   
  Family:     flat plate blank
  Size:       50x50x3
  Data source: Parametric rectangular plate centered on the origin; hole patterns are caller-supplied.
  Notes:      Rectangular flat plate blank centered on the XY origin with optional circular through holes. No edge treatment or material tolerance is asserted.
  Features modeled:      body, through-holes
  Features omitted:      edge-chamfers (no edge treatment is asserted); material-and-tolerances (the plate is a nominal geometric blank)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
